      "english": "Please don't move.",
      "notes": "Negative request form",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "00904_ugoku_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦この→この：00962_kono⟧⟦{時計|とけい}→時計：00677_tokei⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧{動|うご}いていません。",
