        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "00904_ugoku_ex4",
      "japanese": "⟦{地震|じしん}→地震：01608_jishin⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{建物|たてもの}→建物：01458_tatemono⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{動|うご}いた⟦ように→よう：01114_you⟧⟦{感|かん}じました→感じる：02044_kanjiru⟧。",
      "english": "I felt like the building moved during the earthquake.",
